.TH SDL_GetOpenHarmonyInternalStoragePath 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetOpenHarmonyInternalStoragePath \- Get the path used for internal storage for this OpenHarmony application.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_system.h>
.PP
.BI "const char * SDL_GetOpenHarmonyInternalStoragePath(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This path is unique to your application and cannot be written to by other applications\[char46]
.PP
Your internal storage path is typically:
.BR /data/storage/el2/base/files \[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the path used for internal storage or NULL on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

